{"decision": "The selected message-history interpretation is supported by the surrounding Pod Message Backfill section, beyond the one-line candidate-free caller excerpt.", "evidence": [{"endLine": 3558, "excerptSha256": "b36feadd92f3eb9ab8aa2c22b095f279436e8341724378a105fa3c0be146687a", "fileSha256": "849f152db2ed0ebbfa628d5f4ea4c2fc521b74a82ccff7b895832b2b72edf1a6", "gitBlob": "c94043d478085e3e2df432c19d4dbd087d94cf29", "lines": ["        {/* Pod Message Backfill */}", "        <Grid.Column style={{ display: isPodWorkflowVisible(\"pod-message-backfill\") ? undefined : \"none\" }} width={16}>", "          <Card id=\"pod-message-backfill\" fluid>", "            <Card.Content>", "              <Card.Header>", "                <Icon name=\"sync\" />", "                <LocalizedText source={\"Pod Message Backfill\"} /></Card.Header>", "              <Card.Description>", "                <LocalizedText source={\"Synchronize missed messages when peers rejoin pods\"} /></Card.Description>", "              <PodWorkflowNotice title={interfaceText(\"Syncs local pod state\")} {...interfaceTextProps(\"Syncs local pod state\")}>", "                <LocalizedText source={\"Backfill sync uses last-seen timestamps to request missed messages. Confirm the target pod before syncing all channels.\"} /></PodWorkflowNotice>", "            </Card.Content>", "", "            {/* Message Backfill */}", "            <Card.Content>", "              <Header size=\"small\"><LocalizedText source={\"Backfill Management\"} /></Header>"], "path": "src/web/src/components/System/MediaCore/MediaCorePods.jsx", "startLine": 3543}, {"endLine": 3624, "excerptSha256": "b4100d94cd92daeff9b7f8512a2ffc3c6c8eb2dac43e806bb456005bf5a78394", "fileSha256": "849f152db2ed0ebbfa628d5f4ea4c2fc521b74a82ccff7b895832b2b72edf1a6", "gitBlob": "c94043d478085e3e2df432c19d4dbd087d94cf29", "lines": ["              <Header size=\"small\"><LocalizedText source={\"Pod Backfill Review\"} /></Header>", "              <Input", "  